{"overview":"آن می‌اوک و چوی هو سئوک کارگر طبقه متوسط که از زمان مدرسهٔ راهنمایی با هم هستند و پدر و مادر یک کودک ۱۰ سالهٔ ساکت‌اند، هنوز در حال کنار آمدن با پیامدهای اخراج هو سئوک از کار کارخانه‌اش پس از سرکوب خشونت‌آمیز اعتصاب اتحادیه کارگری هستند؛ لی یه‌جی ثروتمند، مستندساز، به همراه شوهر تجاری‌اش، سانگ‌وو، تصمیم گرفته‌اند فیلمی دربارهٔ اخراج‌های شغلی بسازند و می‌اوک و هو سئوک را به عنوان سوژهٔ اصلی دوربین خود انتخاب کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Working-class An Mi Ok and Choi Ho Seok, who have been together since middle school and are the parents of a taciturn 10-year-old, are still reckoning with the fallout from Ho Seok’s firing from his factory job after a violently suppressed labor union strike. The well-off Lee Ye Ji, a documentary filmmaker, with her businessman husband, Sang-woo, has decided to make a movie about job layoffs and wants to make Mi-Ok and Ho-Seok her main camera subjects.","tagline_en":"","runtime":165,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["이창동"],"crew_en":["Lee Chang-dong"],"countries":["KR","US"],"cast":[{"name":"전도연","role":"Mi-ok","photo":"/ev2tT7ZbReE06rZy7SX0Mv8evZ7.jpg","en":"Jeon Do-yeon"},{"name":"설경구","role":"Ho-seok","photo":"/teD7AMzfNl4qhQO2b6MAWwLtPVn.jpg","en":"Sul Kyung-gu"},{"name":"조인성","role":"Sang-woo","photo":"/69gbyFI0ET0l0dyjKChlx1Zx269.jpg","en":"Zo In-sung"},{"name":"چو یو جونگ","role":"Ye-ji","photo":"/5MgWM8pkUiYkj9MEaEpO0Ir1FD9.jpg","en":"Cho Yeo-jeong"},{"name":"جو یو ری","role":"Young Mi-ok","photo":"/4GwoDQFPwpaKldOTpGrIJUzBa9h.jpg","en":"Jo Yuri"},{"name":"최민","role":"Young Ho-seok","photo":"","en":"Choi Min"},{"name":"정섶","role":"Cheol","photo":"/vMbZObKiMc2am3OOFWAlxlPHnpn.jpg","en":"Jeong Seop"},{"name":"강창권","role":"Min-sik","photo":"","en":"Kang Chang-gwon"},{"name":"전운종","role":"Jeong-dae","photo":"/3Ex4iON29UAHgy0BCTS2NukxAnl.jpg","en":"Jeon Woon-jong"},{"name":"이주환","role":"Director of Photography","photo":"","en":"Lee Ju-hwan"},{"name":"이혜린","role":"Producer","photo":"","en":"